- Entendido, ya voy.

556
00:34:31,945 --> 00:34:33,747
¡Va, va!

557
00:34:39,993 --> 00:34:41,083
Boyd.

558
00:34:41,753 --> 00:34:42,903
Boyd.

559
00:34:51,122 --> 00:34:52,309
Mierda.

560
